DvD IOPaint Interactive Eraser

The erase-model URLs, checksums, preprocessing behavior, and vendored runtime
sources in this plugin are adapted from IOPaint 1.6.0, commit
61a759fb3f332bacdce8b2813f4837495c9b86e0:
https://github.com/Sanster/IOPaint

IOPaint is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The adapted implementation
has been modified for an isolated package namespace, Python 3.13 compatibility,
ComfyUI model paths, device handling, error handling, and the interactive node
workflow.
